units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
run_style verlet
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 every 1 check yes
lattice fcc 3.52
region whole block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol density
thermo_modify flush yes
velocity all create 600 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
reset_timestep 0
run v_nsteps
